{"slug":"/students/subjects/physics/properties/","source":"students/subjects/physics/properties/index.html","area":"students","kind":"division","title":"Properties of Matter | Physics","description":"","subject":"physics","body":"<div class=\"max-w-5xl mx-auto\">\n    <nav class=\"mb-6\"><a href=\"/students/subjects/physics/\" class=\"text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700\">← Back to Physics</a></nav>\n\n    <main class=\"card rounded-xl p-8\">\n      <header class=\"mb-6\">\n        <h1 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-gray-800\">Properties of Matter</h1>\n        <p class=\"text-gray-600 mt-2\">Core topics: equilibrium in liquids, density, elasticity, deformation and vibrations.</p>\n      </header>\n\n      <div class=\"grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2\">\n        <a href=\"/students/subjects/physics/properties/matter/\" class=\"block p-6 rounded-lg bg-white/60 hover:bg-white/70 transition\">\n          <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800\">Introduction to matter</h2>\n          <p class=\"text-gray-600 mt-2\">Definition, kinetic theory of matter, change of states, cohesive and adhesive forces, surface tension, capillarity.</p>\n        </a>\n\n        <a href=\"/students/subjects/physics/properties/equilibrium-in-liquids/\" class=\"block p-6 rounded-lg bg-white/60 hover:bg-white/70 transition\">\n          <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800\">Equilibrium of Body in Liquids</h2>\n          <p class=\"text-gray-600 mt-2\">Buoyancy, Archimedes' principle, floatation and stability.</p>\n        </a>\n\n        <a href=\"/students/subjects/physics/properties/density-relative-density/\" class=\"block p-6 rounded-lg bg-white/60 hover:bg-white/70 transition\">\n          <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800\">Density &amp; Relative Density</h2>\n          <p class=\"text-gray-600 mt-2\">Definition, units, measurement methods and sample problems.</p>\n        </a>\n\n        <a href=\"/students/subjects/physics/properties/elastic-properties/\" class=\"block p-6 rounded-lg bg-white/60 hover:bg-white/70 transition\">\n          <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800\">Elastic Properties of Solids</h2>\n          <p class=\"text-gray-600 mt-2\">Stress, strain, Young's modulus, bulk and shear modulus.</p>\n        </a>\n\n        <a href=\"/students/subjects/physics/properties/deformation-of-solids/\" class=\"block p-6 rounded-lg bg-white/60 hover:bg-white/70 transition\">\n          <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800\">Deformation of Solids</h2>\n          <p class=\"text-gray-600 mt-2\">Hooke's law, elastic &amp; plastic deformation, stress-strain curves.</p>\n        </a>\n\n        <a href=\"/students/subjects/physics/properties/vibration-shm/\" class=\"block p-6 rounded-lg bg-white/60 hover:bg-white/70 transition\">\n          <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800\">Vibration &amp; SHM</h2>\n          <p class=\"text-gray-600 mt-2\">Mass-spring oscillations, pipes, SHM equations and examples.</p>\n        </a>\n\n      </div>\n\n      <footer class=\"mt-8 text-sm text-gray-500\">Created to match the existing physics division style.</footer>\n    </main>\n  </div>","bodyClass":"min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-50 to-blue-50 p-6","bodyStyle":"","css":["body{font-family:Inter, sans-serif}\n    .card{ -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px); backdrop-filter: blur(12px); background:rgba(255,255,255,0.78); border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.35); box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.06)}"],"quiz":null,"tracker":null,"links":[]}